OL,3,ANurse killed in attack while responding
OL,4,Ato Ebola alert in DR Congo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nurse has been killed and another
OL,7,Fhealth worker seriously injured in an
OL,8,Fattack as they were responding to an
OL,9,FEbola alert in north-eastern Democratic
OL,10,FRepublic of Congo.
OL,12,FThe two were targeted by local youths
OL,13,Fwho accused them of contaminating water
OL,14,Fsources and spreading the Ebola virus,
OL,15,Faccording to the UN-backed Radio Okapi.
OL,16,FThe World Health Organization (WHO)
OL,17,Fcondemned the attack.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
