OL,3,ANurse killed in attack while responding
OL,4,Ato Ebola alert in DR Congo
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an attempt to prevent the virus
OL,7,Fspreading, neighbouring Uganda has
OL,8,Fbanned all non-essential travel to and
OL,9,Ffrom DR Congo and says its citizens
OL,10,Freturning from there will be
OL,11,Fquarantined for 21 days.
OL,13,FMore than 4,800 people have died and
OL,14,Fnearly 10,000 been infected in DR Congo
OL,15,Fsince this outbreak began in May.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
